      "locator": "instructions_visible_now.paraphrase, based on the previously inspected PDF4 / printed3.",
      "paraphrase": [
        "Addition/subtraction precision follows the least precise approximate datum's decimal place.",
        "Multiplication/division significant figures follow the approximate datum with the fewest significant figures.",
        "Squares/cubes retain the approximate base's significant-figure count; the last digit is less reliable.",
        "Square/cube roots retain the approximate radicand's significant-figure count; the last digit is more reliable.",
        "Intermediate results retain one extra reserve digit, dropped at the end; the reserve digit is recommended to be underlined."
